  "task": "# Relay stage 1: Ideate\nTask: improve-task-card-styles\nWorking directory: /tmp/nix-shell.cYQvM3/visual-relay/wt/fbb5c78605a5/plan-20260707052814/improve-task-card-styles\n\n## Task input\n# Improve Task Card Styles\n\nIn the list of tasks, the cards have some rough styles that could use some improvements.\n\nFor one, they all have square edges despite their being a rounded edge within that. We don't need the outer square edges.\n\nWe should also make sure that it's apparent that a card is both active and in progress. Right now, we represent those with blue and green. The combined style should do something like a blue rounded rectangle border on the outside of the existing green rounded rectangle/border.\n\nand make sure you don't add the square corners; rounded cornders for all states (default, active, in progress, and combined active + in progress).\n\n## Manifest\n(not set yet)\n\n## Task context\n### Screenshot 2026-07-06 at 9.51.51\u202fPM.png (35934 bytes, not inlined)\n\n## Prior stages\n\n\nEnd your reply with a single fenced ```json block, nothing after it, matching: { \"summary\": string, \"options\": string[] }",
